    // ----------------------------------------------------------
    // Section 3: Baugh-Wooley correction constant
    //
    // The 30 inversions (15 sign-col + 15 sign-row) each at
    // positions 15..29 add a spurious 0x7fff0000 to the raw sum.
    // Adding 0x80010000 cancels it modulo 2^32:
    //   0x7fff0000 + 0x80010000 = 0x1_0000_0000 ≡ 0 (mod 2^32)
    // ----------------------------------------------------------
